### Model Description
A custom, lightweight Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) trained from scratch. 
The architecture consists of:
1. 4 Convolutional blocks (Conv2D -> BatchNorm2D -> ReLU -> MaxPool2D).
2. An Adaptive Average Pooling layer.
3. A fully connected classifier head with Dropout (p=0.3) for regularization.

### Manipulations and Robustness Experiments
- **Baseline (No Augmentation)**: Trained on the full 50% split (10,000 images) for 3 epochs on CPU.
  - Local Clean Accuracy: 57.15%
  - Color Jitter Robustness: 57.25%
  - Random Rotation Robustness: 58.75%
- **Robust Training (Underway)**: Adding spatial and color transformations directly into the training data loader (RandomResizedCrop, RandomHorizontalFlip, RandomRotation, ColorJitter, RandomGrayscale, RandomErasing) to ensure background and lighting invariance.
